{
  "$schema": "https://jxsuite.com/schema/v1",
  "$id": "StudioPanelI18n",
  "$description": "The Languages panel: a grid over ABSENCE, one row per translation key and one column per declared locale, drawn from the projection `panels/i18n-panel.ts` hands in. Every square is a button and every button is a command run by id, so the document draws a state, a glyph and a sentence and decides nothing: which command a cell runs, whether it is refused and what the refusal says are all settled before the scope is written. Three bodies rather than one, because a monolingual project and a project still being read are not empty versions of the grid — they are different answers to the same question.",
  "tagName": "div",
  "attributes": {
    "part": "panel"
  },
  "style": {
    "$description": "The panel's own look, taken out of `styles/panels.css`'s `.i18n-*` block. Three tokens changed meaning on the way: `--spectrum-font-size-50`, `--spectrum-font-size-75` and `--spectrum-corner-radius-75` resolved only inside `<sp-theme>`, and this document is mounted into the Navigator's `.panel-body`, where that element is not an ancestor — every one of them would silently have taken its px fallback. They are the kit's scale here (`--jx-text-sm`, `--jx-text-md`, `--jx-radius-xs`), which is what those three Spectrum steps were.",
    "display": "flex",
    "flexDirection": "column",
    "gap": "8px",
    "padding": "8px",
    "minWidth": "0",
    "fontFamily": "var(--jx-font-sans)",
    "color": "var(--fg)",
    "& [part=\"empty\"]": {
      "$description": "The teaching empty state, drawn here rather than borrowed from `panels/empty-state.ts`: that helper is a lit template and a document cannot call one. Its rules are what is kept — one sentence saying what the region is FOR, then where its content comes from, then the action that fills it — in the centred shape a whole empty region uses.",
      "display": "flex",
      "flexDirection": "column",
      "alignItems": "center",
      "gap": "8px",
      "padding": "24px",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "fontSize": "13px",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)"
    },
    "& [part=\"empty\"][data-compact=\"true\"]": {
      "$description": "The same state as a note INSIDE an otherwise populated panel — the grid's summary and its Rescan button are still above it, so a centred block with 24px of air around it would read as a second, emptier panel.",
      "alignItems": "flex-start",
      "gap": "4px",
      "padding": "8px 12px",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-sm)"
    },
    "& [part=\"empty-message\"], & [part=\"empty-detail\"]": {
      "margin": "0",
      "maxWidth": "34ch",
      "lineHeight": "1.5"
    },
    "& [part=\"empty-detail\"]": {
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-sm)",
      "opacity": "0.8"
    },
    "& [part=\"empty-actions\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "flexWrap": "wrap",
      "justifyContent": "center",
      "gap": "8px"
    },
    "& [part=\"actions\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "alignItems": "baseline",
      "justifyContent": "space-between",
      "gap": "8px"
    },
    "& [part=\"summary\"]": {
      "margin": "0",
      "minWidth": "0",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-sm)"
    },
    "& [part=\"rescan\"]": {
      "flex": "none",
      "padding": "2px 8px",
      "border": "1px solid var(--border)",
      "borderRadius": "var(--jx-radius-xs)",
      "background": "transparent",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)",
      "font": "inherit",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-sm)",
      "cursor": "pointer"
    },
    "& [part=\"rescan\"]:hover": {
      "color": "var(--fg)",
      "background": "var(--hover-bg)"
    },
    "& [part=\"incomplete\"]": {
      "$description": "A directory the scan could not read makes the whole grid a partial answer, so it says so ABOVE the table rather than letting an unreadable `content/` read as a project with no content.",
      "margin": "0",
      "padding": "4px 6px",
      "borderLeft": "3px solid var(--warning)",
      "borderRadius": "var(--radius)",
      "background": "var(--bg-panel)",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-sm)"
    },
    "& [part=\"parity\"]": {
      "$description": "The Navigator is narrow and a key is a path, so the table scrolls sideways rather than wrapping every path onto four lines.",
      "display": "block",
      "overflowX": "auto",
      "borderCollapse": "collapse",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-md)"
    },
    "& [part=\"key-head\"], & [part=\"locale-head\"]": {
      "padding": "2px 6px",
      "borderBottom": "1px solid var(--border)",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-sm)",
      "fontWeight": "700",
      "textAlign": "start",
      "textTransform": "uppercase",
      "letterSpacing": "0.04em",
      "whiteSpace": "nowrap"
    },
    "& [part=\"default-mark\"]": {
      "marginInlineStart": "4px",
      "color": "var(--accent)",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "letterSpacing": "normal"
    },
    "& [part=\"row\"]:hover": {
      "background": "var(--hover-bg)"
    },
    "& [part=\"key\"]": {
      "maxWidth": "220px",
      "overflow": "hidden",
      "padding": "2px 6px",
      "color": "var(--fg)",
      "fontFamily": "var(--font-mono)",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-sm)",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "textAlign": "start",
      "textOverflow": "ellipsis",
      "whiteSpace": "nowrap"
    },
    "& [part=\"cell\"]": {
      "padding": "2px 6px",
      "textAlign": "center"
    },
    "& [part=\"cell-button\"]": {
      "$description": "The glyph carries the state and the colour repeats it, the way a problem row's severity does, because a column of squares is read by scanning rather than by reading. The state is an attribute rather than a class: a document styles through `part` and the data it already carries, never through a class name (ui.md §3.1).",
      "inlineSize": "22px",
      "blockSize": "18px",
      "border": "1px solid var(--border)",
      "borderRadius": "var(--jx-radius-xs)",
      "background": "transparent",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)",
      "font": "inherit",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-md)",
      "lineHeight": "1",
      "cursor": "pointer"
    },
    "& [part=\"cell-button\"]:hover:not(:disabled)": {
      "background": "var(--hover-bg)"
    },
    "& [part=\"cell-button\"]:disabled": {
      "cursor": "default",
      "opacity": "0.45"
    },
    "& [part=\"cell-button\"][data-state=\"present\"]": {
      "color": "var(--success)"
    },
    "& [part=\"cell-button\"][data-state=\"stale\"]": {
      "color": "var(--warning)",
      "borderColor": "var(--warning)"
    },
    "& [part=\"cell-button\"][data-state=\"missing\"]": {
      "color": "var(--accent)",
      "borderStyle": "dashed"
    },
    "& [part=\"truncated\"]": {
      "margin": "0",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-sm)"
    }
  },
  "children": [
    {
      "tagName": "div",
      "attributes": {
        "part": "body-slot",
        "role": "none"
      },
      "style": {
        "display": "contents"
      },
      "$switch": {
        "$ref": "#/state/mode"
      },
      "cases": {
        "mono": {
          "tagName": "div",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "empty"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "tagName": "p",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "empty-message"
              },
              "textContent": "This project is written in one language."
            },
            {
              "tagName": "p",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "empty-detail"
              },
              "textContent": "Declare them under Locales in the project's settings, then a page's translations are sibling files under a directory named for each language."
            },
            {
              "tagName": "div",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "empty-actions"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tagName": "jx-button",
                  "$props": {
                    "size": "sm",
                    "disabled": {
                      "$ref": "#/state/settingsDisabled"
                    }
                  },
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "settings"
                  },
                  "onclick": {
                    "$prototype": "Function",
                    "body": [
                      {
                        "operator": "call",
                        "target": {
                          "$ref": "#/state/openSettings"
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "tagName": "span",
                      "textContent": "Open project settings…"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        "scanning": {
          "tagName": "div",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "empty"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "tagName": "p",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "empty-message"
              },
              "textContent": "Looking for translations…"
            },
            {
              "tagName": "p",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "empty-detail"
              },
              "textContent": "Reading pages/ and content/ to find out which languages each page is written in."
            }
          ]
        },
        "grid": {
          "tagName": "div",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "grid",
            "role": "none"
          },
          "style": {
            "display": "contents"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "tagName": "div",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "actions"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tagName": "p",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "summary"
                  },
                  "textContent": "${state.summary}"
                },
                {
                  "tagName": "button",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "rescan",
                    "type": "button",
                    "title": "Read pages/ and content/ again"
                  },
                  "onclick": {
                    "$prototype": "Function",
                    "body": [
                      {
                        "operator": "call",
                        "target": {
                          "$ref": "#/state/rescan"
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  "textContent": "Rescan"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "tagName": "div",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "incomplete-slot",
                "role": "none"
              },
              "style": {
                "display": "contents"
              },
              "$switch": {
                "$ref": "#/state/hasIncomplete"
              },
              "cases": {
                "true": {
                  "tagName": "p",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "incomplete"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "tagName": "span",
                      "textContent": "This list is incomplete — "
                    },
                    {
                      "tagName": "span",
                      "textContent": "${state.incomplete}"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "tagName": "div",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "list-slot",
                "role": "none"
              },
              "style": {
                "display": "contents"
              },
              "$switch": {
                "$ref": "#/state/hasRows"
              },
              "cases": {
                "false": {
                  "tagName": "div",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "empty",
                    "data-compact": "true"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "tagName": "p",
                      "attributes": {
                        "part": "empty-message"
                      },
                      "textContent": "There is nothing to translate yet."
                    },
                    {
                      "tagName": "p",
                      "attributes": {
                        "part": "empty-detail"
                      },
                      "textContent": "Add a page under pages/, or an entry to a content collection."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "true": {
                  "tagName": "table",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "parity"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "tagName": "thead",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "tagName": "tr",
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "tagName": "th",
                              "attributes": {
                                "part": "key-head",
                                "scope": "col"
                              },
                              "textContent": "Page"
                            },
                            {
                              "$prototype": "Array",
                              "items": {
                                "$ref": "#/state/heads"
                              },
                              "key": {
                                "$ref": "$map/item/locale"
                              },
                              "map": {
                                "tagName": "th",
                                "attributes": {
                                  "part": "locale-head",
                                  "scope": "col",
                                  "title": "${$map.item.locale}"
                                },
                                "children": [
                                  {
                                    "tagName": "span",
                                    "textContent": "${$map.item.label}"
                                  },
                                  {
                                    "tagName": "span",
                                    "attributes": {
                                      "part": "default-slot",
                                      "role": "none"
                                    },
                                    "style": {
                                      "display": "contents"
                                    },
                                    "$switch": {
                                      "$ref": "$map/item/isDefault"
                                    },
                                    "cases": {
                                      "true": {
                                        "tagName": "span",
                                        "attributes": {
                                          "part": "default-mark"
                                        },
                                        "textContent": "source"
                                      }
                                    }
                                  }
                                ]
                              }
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "tagName": "tbody",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "$prototype": "Array",
                          "items": {
                            "$ref": "#/state/rows"
                          },
                          "key": {
                            "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                          },
                          "map": {
                            "tagName": "tr",
                            "attributes": {
                              "part": "row"
                            },
                            "children": [
                              {
                                "tagName": "th",
                                "attributes": {
                                  "part": "key",
                                  "scope": "row",
                                  "title": "${$map.item.key}"
                                },
                                "textContent": "${$map.item.key}"
                              },
                              {
                                "$prototype": "Array",
                                "items": {
                                  "$ref": "$map/item/cells"
                                },
                                "key": {
                                  "$ref": "$map/item/locale"
                                },
                                "map": {
                                  "tagName": "td",
                                  "attributes": {
                                    "part": "cell"
                                  },
                                  "children": [
                                    {
                                      "tagName": "button",
                                      "attributes": {
                                        "part": "cell-button",
                                        "type": "button",
                                        "data-state": "${$map.item.state}",
                                        "disabled": {
                                          "$ref": "$map/item/disabled"
                                        },
                                        "title": "${$map.item.title}",
                                        "aria-label": "${$map.item.title}"
                                      },
                                      "onclick": {
                                        "$prototype": "Function",
                                        "body": [
                                          {
                                            "operator": "call",
                                            "target": {
                                              "$ref": "#/state/runCell"
                                            },
                                            "value": [
                                              {
                                                "$ref": "$map/item/command"
                                              },
                                              {
                                                "$ref": "$map/item/locale"
                                              },
                                              {
                                                "$ref": "$map/item/rowPath"
                                              }
                                            ]
                                          }
                                        ]
                                      },
                                      "children": [
                                        {
                                          "tagName": "span",
                                          "attributes": {
                                            "aria-hidden": "true"
                                          },
                                          "textContent": "${$map.item.glyph}"
                                        }
                                      ]
                                    }
                                  ]
                                }
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "tagName": "div",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "truncated-slot",
                "role": "none"
              },
              "style": {
                "display": "contents"
              },
              "$switch": {
                "$ref": "#/state/hasTruncated"
              },
              "cases": {
                "true": {
                  "tagName": "p",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "truncated"
                  },
                  "textContent": "${state.truncated}"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
